  "description": "Experience the thrill of extreme off-road performance with our Carbon Fiber Full Suspension Electric Mountain Bike. Engineered with a stiff carbon fiber frame and powered by the formidable Bafang Ultra motor, this bike is designed to conquer any trail effortlessly.\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful Motor: 1000W Bafang Ultra Mid-drive Motor for unrivaled off-road performance.\n\nHigh Torque: 160Nm of torque for conquering extreme hills with ease.\n\nGenerous Load Capacity: Supports up to 265lbs, allowing you to bring all your gear for the ride.\n\nOn-Demand Throttle: Pedal optional with the convenient on-demand throttle feature.\n\nSmooth Pedal Assistance: Torque and cadence sensors provide smooth and powerful pedal assist.\n\nLong-lasting Battery: Includes a 48V 17.5Ah 840Wh battery and charger for extended riding adventures.\n\nBenefits:\n\nConquer any trail with confidence and precision.\nTackle steep hills with power and ease.\nBring along all your gear without sacrificing performance.\nEnjoy the option to pedal or use the throttle for effortless riding.\nExperience smooth and powerful pedal assistance for a comfortable ride.\nRide for miles without worrying about running out of power.\n\nElevate your off-road adventures with the Carbon Fiber Full Suspension Electric Mountain Bike. Conquer new trails, push your limits, and make every ride an exhilarating adventure.",
